# TYPE + HEADER
# Example: FEAT: add client project dashboard


# DESCRIPTION
# Explain why the change was needed, not how it was implemented.
# Wrap longer descriptions at approximately 72 characters.



# [ FEAT BUG CHG REFAC PERF DATA TOOL COPY DOC SPEC WIP ]
#
# FEAT  New user-facing functionality
# BUG   Fix incorrect behavior
# CHG   Change existing behavior, configuration, or dependencies
# REFAC Restructure code without changing behavior
# PERF  Improve performance
# DATA  Change database schemas, migrations, seeds, or stored data
# TOOL  Change tooling, builds, infrastructure, or development setup
# COPY  Change user-facing content
# DOC   Change documentation
# SPEC  Add or update tests
# WIP   Incomplete work that should not be released